      either "NWC" (default) or "NCW", for N=2 it can be either "NHWC" (default)
      or "NCHW" and for N=3 either "NDHWC" (default) or "NCDHW".
    name: Optional name for the operation.

  Returns:
    A `Tensor` of format specified by `data_format`.
